  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You've been a real asset to the Order, young Wizard. With the Pekron data we've gathered, I believe we're close to some valuable insights!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_21.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The first thing we need to ascertain is at what point these Pekrons will produce a Pekuliarity. That'll tell us how imminent the threat really is.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_22.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Using the data, I've collected several flasks of air highly concentrated with Pekrons. However, I need your help to test out my theory.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_23.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We need somewhere a little more... remote. Just in case, of course. Meet me at Unicorn Park and we'll find out just how volatile these Pekrons can be!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_24.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perfect! You're here just in time. You weren't followed, were you? I think there are some who seek to hinder our research. Very suspicious...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_25.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Where was I though? Oh yes! The Pekrons. I am going to add increasing levels of Pekrons to this cauldron, until they produce a Pekuliarity.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_26.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You simply need to stand beside the cauldron so your badge can be exposed to it. I'll collect the reading when we're done.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_GEN|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GRV/AegonStatz_GRV_27.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
